  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">18-WWF &#x2013; From Waste to Value: Tapping the market for recycled plastic in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will develop a sustainable and profitable market for recycled plastic in Kenya, by capacity building in collection, sorting and processing of plastic. Will improve livelihoods in counties on the coast by creating 5000 decent jobs</narrative>
